WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.070
In 782 BC,
by the date most often given,

2
00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:09.030
Argishti I, king of Urartu,

3
00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:12.459
raised a new fortress
on the hill of Arin Berd.

4
00:00:12.499 --> 00:00:14.375
He named it Erebuni.

5
00:00:14.615 --> 00:00:17.805
His founding inscription,
cut in cuneiform,

6
00:00:17.845 --> 00:00:19.645
still tells the story.

7
00:00:19.722 --> 00:00:22.652
No siege of Erebuni is recorded:

8
00:00:22.692 --> 00:00:25.821
the battle ahead
is an invention of the game.

9
00:00:26.061 --> 00:00:28.801
Yet the name lives on in Yerevan.

10
00:00:29.041 --> 00:00:31.748
Defend the young city.

